# cyto genome exported from cell 0 — load it via Load Genome (rename to cyto-brush.gene).
Break rr : Biomass < 4000 : Convert rr @15
Light : rr < 8000 & rg < 1000 : FormBond r r
Break rb : rg < 1000 : FormBond r r @7
Break rr : rb < 1000 : FormBond r g @7
Break rg : rr < 1000 : FormBond r b @7
Break rb : rr < 999 & rg < 999 & rb < 999 : FormBond r r
Break rg : rr < 1000 & rg > 6000 : Contract @15
Break rg : rr < 1000 & rg > 21500 : Divide across r @15
Break rr : rb < 1000 : Repair @15
